  "description": "A viral video takes social media by storm—featuring a man crying. But not just any man. He weeps beautifully...\n\nHee-seung, a bold and straightforward younger man, once shared a passionate love with Hae-bin during their university days. They lived together, even registering their marriage. But Hee-seung was secretly the youngest son of the powerful Ilwoo Group. His older brother, Hee-tae, schemed to drive them apart, forcing Hae-bin into a fake affair to manipulate Hee-seung into divorce.\n\nBlinded by misunderstanding, Hee-seung broke down in tears in the middle of Dosan Boulevard. Unbeknownst to him, someone captured that moment and uploaded it online—turning him into a fleeting sensation, The Man Who Cries Beautifully.\n\nSix years later, fate brings them together once more.\n\nThis time, Hee-seung approaches Hae-bin under the guise of revenge.\n\n\"Don't be happy, Seo Hae-bin. Don't you dare smile where I can't see you.\"\n\n\"I thought seeing you again would tear me apart. But… my heart doesn’t even flutter.\"\n\n\"Let’s meet often, Hae-bin. Until I’m certain you mean nothing to me.\"\n\nA romance filled with heart-wrenching dialogue and deep emotions—get ready for a love story that aches to the core. \n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/59865343)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62367218), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%88%EC%81%98%EA%B2%8C-%EC%9A%B0%EB%8A%94-%EB%82%A8%EC%9E%90/3661)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171851)",
